      "message": "What happens if the user calls a method that\u0027s not here, such as insertEntry? We should either implement it, or have something like:\n\n\n    @Override\n    public void insertEntry(K key, V value) throws ErrnoException {\n        throw new UnsupportedOperationException();\n    }\n\nso if any test ever calls it there\u0027s a clear error. Doesn\u0027t need to be in this CL.",
